{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach and grab it, then check properties and do specific task, move if necessary. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = Move    /> <SubTree ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
